27. Summary

Community Use applies when mistakes are cheap, reversible, and retry-safe.

Growth / Limited Commercial Use applies when mistakes may matter at scale.

Full Commercial Use applies when mistakes are expensive from day one.

The guiding principle is:

If “try again” is an acceptable recovery strategy, Community License likely applies.
If “try again” is not an acceptable recovery strategy, Commercial License likely applies.
